<title>UK: 3i Group sets 1.0 bln stg debt programme.</title>
<headline>3i Group sets 1.0 bln stg debt programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>3i Group Plc has set up a 1.0 billion stg ($1.7 billion) note issuance programme, it said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The programme will allow for issues by 3I Group plc, 3I Holdings plc, 3I plc and 3I International B.V.</p>
<p>All notes will be guaranteed by 3I Group plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748 ($ = 0.593 British Pounds)</p>
